  "details": "the website & client both act and have some features that the other doesnt so it makes some things become obscure like the group reporting feature or group names just simply not being shown on the website for instances.\n\nwould be nice if the website & client was more similar then what they currently are.\n\nthe way that it could be changed is not even difficult for example: on the website when looking at instances you can show a small group symbol next to the region symbol then the group name instead of just \"Group Public\"\n\nin the client you should be able to report groups in the same way as the website but for some really wack reason you can only report groups in the client for either text or image instead of everything that you can on the website.\n\non the website you also cannot see what group someone is representing even though it would be nice to see that on the website aswell.",
